title=\"20-df-redeg\">20-df-redeg</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"91065cedbdf2fc27\" href=\"?note=91065cedbdf2fc27\" title=\"20-df-low-high\">20-df-low-high</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0c35680c0004f5e2\" href=\"?note=0c35680c0004f5e2\" title=\"20-df-formula\">20-df-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d4a7833057f5a20e\" href=\"?note=d4a7833057f5a20e\" title=\"20-df-satisfaction\">20-df-satisfaction</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak R=(\\mathcal R_{\\mathrm{deg}},\\le)\">\\(\\mathfrak R=(\\mathcal R_{\\mathrm{deg}},\\le)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_\\le\">\\(\\mathcal L_\\le\\)</span> 只有一个二元关系符号；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Form}_1\">\\(\\operatorname{Form}_1\\)</span> 表示仅 v_0 自由的公式。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"f389bdba28de0478\" href=\"?note=f389bdba28de0478\" title=\"20-df-redeg\">20-df-redeg</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"91065cedbdf2fc27\" href=\"?note=91065cedbdf2fc27\" title=\"20-df-low-high\">20-df-low-high</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"0c35680c0004f5e2\" href=\"?note=0c35680c0004f5e2\" title=\"20-df-formula\">20-df-formula</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"d4a7833057f5a20e\" href=\"?note=d4a7833057f5a20e\" title=\"20-df-satisfaction\">20-df-satisfaction</a>。</p>\n<aside class=\"callout\" data-kind=\"todo\"><div class=\"callout-title\">核验边界</div><p>本条状态为 source-statement-proof-pending；正文给出修订后的定义或命题草案，尚缺完整来源核对或独立证明。不可仅凭文件类型将其作为已认证定理使用。</p>\n</aside>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}nss\\text{-}def}\\vdash\n\\forall n\\ge2\\ \\exists\\lambda_n,\\eta_{n-1}\\in\\operatorname{Form}_1(\\mathcal L_\\le)\\\n\\forall\\mathbf a\\in\\mathcal R_{\\mathrm{deg}}\\\n[(\\mathfrak R\\models\\lambda_n[\\mathbf a]\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathbf a\\in L_n)\n\\land(\\mathfrak R\\models\\eta_{n-1}[\\mathbf a]\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathbf a\\in H_{n-1})].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}nss\\text{-}def}\\vdash\n\\forall n\\ge2\\ \\exists\\lambda_n,\\eta_{n-1}\\in\\operatorname{Form}_1(\\mathcal L_\\le)\\\n\\forall\\mathbf a\\in\\mathcal R_{\\mathrm{deg}}\\\n[(\\mathfrak R\\models\\lambda_n[\\mathbf a]\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathbf a\\in L_n)\n\\land(\\mathfrak R\\models\\eta_{n-1}[\\mathbf a]\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathbf a\\in H_{n-1})].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>核实原论文结论后，改为 c.e. 度结构内部、不带参数的 low_n（n≥2）和 high_(n−1) 可定义性。原稿“c.e. 度在全部 Turing 度结构中可定义”不是这篇论文的该结论。此处只核实论文摘要与准确陈述；具体定义公式及长证明尚未重建，不以存在量词冒充已给出公式。</p>\n<p>来源：<a href=\"https://londmathsoc.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/abs/10.1112/S002461159800046X\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Nies–Shore–Slaman, Interpretability and Definability in the Recursively Enumerable Degrees (1998), DOI 10.1112/S002461159800046X</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-redeg","status":"resolved","id":"f389bdba28de0478","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-redeg]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-low-high","status":"resolved","id":"91065cedbdf2fc27","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-low-high]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"0c35680c0004f5e2","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-satisfaction","